# Catalog & products

- Add/edit phones only in `src/lib/products.ts`. Keep `id` and `slug` unique.
- `storage[0]` is the base price tier for `getUnitPrice` relative premiums.
- Cart/order lines identify by `productId` + `color` + `storage`.
- Product visuals use `PhoneVisual` + `imageGradient` (CSS), not required photo assets.
- Update `docs/DOMAIN_MODEL.md` when pricing rules or the Product shape change.
